---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { canonicalPages } from '../../lib/site-pages';
const metadata = canonicalPages.find((page) => page.path === '/privacy/')!;
---
<BaseLayout title={metadata.title} description={metadata.description} canonicalPath={metadata.path}>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,68px)">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Information we collect</h2>
    <h3>Contact details</h3>
    <p>When you use the contact form, we collect the name, phone number, email address, and message you submit. Only include information that is relevant to your message.</p>
    <h3>Website analytics</h3>
    <p>Standard website analytics may record aggregated visit and device information when analytics is enabled. The contact form is handled by Formspark, which may process technical data needed to receive and route the submission.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">How it is used</h2>
    <h3>Replying and operating the service</h3>
    <p>We use contact form information to read your message, reply when appropriate, handle feedback or corrections, and understand which pages helped visitors get in touch. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h3>Service providers</h3>
    <p>Information may be processed by hosting, contact form, analytics, or email providers used to operate the website. These providers receive only the information needed for their role and handle it under their own security and privacy obligations.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Retention and requests</h2>
    <h3>How long information is kept</h3>
    <p>Contact messages are kept only for communication, support, security, and operational needs, then removed when they are no longer required. Retention may vary when information must be preserved to resolve a request, investigate abuse, or meet a legal obligation.</p>
    <h3>Access and correction requests</h3>
    <p>To ask about personal information submitted through this website, use the contact form and include “Privacy request” in your message. Provide enough detail to identify the message without sending additional sensitive information.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
